  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Possessive Power Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/26/En_Sabah_Nur_X-Men_Apocalypse.png/revision/latest?cb=20260204224303\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"En Sabah Nur X-Men Apocalypse\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/26/En_Sabah_Nur_X-Men_Apocalypse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260204224303\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/26/En_Sabah_Nur_X-Men_Apocalypse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260204224303 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/26/En_Sabah_Nur_X-Men_Apocalypse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20260204224303 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"En Sabah Nur X-Men Apocalypse\" width=\"270\" height=\"361\" data-image-key=\"En_Sabah_Nur_X-Men_Apocalypse.png\" data-image-name=\"En Sabah Nur X-Men Apocalypse.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">En Sabah Nur/Apocalypse (X-Men Apocalypse) gains the powers of mutants that he possesses, even retaining them when taking a new host. Accumulation of abilities has made him one of the most powerful mutants to exist.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal powers of others via possession.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div> \n<p>The power to <b>steal the powers of others through possession.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Consciousness_Transferal\" title=\"Consciousness Transferal\">Consciousness Transferal</a>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Possession\" title=\"Possession\">Possession</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Possessive_Power_Replication\" title=\"Possessive Power Replication\">Possessive Power Replication</a>. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Fiction-Specific_Terms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fiction-Specific Terms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Possessive Power Siphoning/Stealing/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fiction-Specific_Terms\">Fiction-Specific Terms</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Plunder (Charlotte)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can gain the powers of others by possessing them, and even retain them when leaving the host, taking on a new host, or returning to their own body.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Possession\" title=\"Possession\">Possession</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ancient Power\">Ancient Power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Human_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Superior Human Physiology\">Superior Human Physiology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Prime_Superior_Human_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prime Superior Human Physiology\">Prime Superior Human Physiology</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption_Immunity\" title=\"Power Absorption Immunity\">Power Absorption Immunity</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Possession_Immunity\" title=\"Possession Immunity\">Possession Immunity</a>.</li>\n<li>Accumulation of multiple abilities may take a toll one the host‘s mind and/or body, making periodic possession a necessity.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://arrow.fandom.com/wiki/Clifford_DeVoe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:arrow:Clifford DeVoe\">Clifford DeVoe/The Thinker</a> (<i>Arrowverse</i>)</li>\n<li>Yuu Otosaka (<i>Charlotte</i>)</li>\n<li>Dark Danny/Dan Phantom (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li>Incubus (<i>DC Extended Universe</i>)</li>\n<li>Orochimaru (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/En_Sabah_Nur_(Earth-TRN414)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:En Sabah Nur (Earth-TRN414)\">En Sabah Nur/Apocalypse</a> (<i>X-Men Movies</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPossessive_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"d2d4988e802304596b85cc14dab7b50f\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Clifford_DeVoe-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px; top:40.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Clifford_DeVoe.png\" title=\"Clifford DeVoe.png (1.31 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e7/Clifford_DeVoe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20180518212401\" title=\"Clifford DeVoe.png (1.31 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Clifford DeVoe/The Thinker (The Flash) can steal the powers of Metas by possessing them, retaining each power with each new host.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Clifford DeVoe.png\" data-image-key=\"Clifford_DeVoe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Clifford DeVoe/The Thinker (The Flash) can steal the powers of Metas by possessing them, retaining each power with each new host.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Clifford DeVoe.png (1.31 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Clifford DeVoe/The Thinker (The Flash) can steal the powers of