hers for five seconds before going back to his own body. If he possesses a fellow ability user, he can take their ability.\" height=\"185\" width=\"149\" data-image-name=\"Yū Otosaka.png\" data-image-key=\"Y%C5%AB_Otosaka.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Yū Otosaka (Charlotte) can possess others for five seconds before going back to his own body. If he possesses a fellow ability user, he can take their ability.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/02/Y%C5%AB_Otosaka.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/57?cb=20160110205538\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Yū Otosaka (Charlotte) can possess others for five seconds before going back to his own body. If he possesses a fellow ability user, he can take their ability.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"S02M02_Danny_and_Vlad_fusion-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:138px; width:185px; top:23.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:S02M02_Danny_and_Vlad_fusion.gif\" title=\"S02M02 Danny and Vlad fusion.gif (3.86 MB)\" style=\"height:138px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/63/S02M02_Danny_and_Vlad_fusion.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20200608195028\" title=\"S02M02 Danny and Vlad fusion.gif (3.86 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Young Dark Danny (Danny Phantom) fusion with Vlad, gaining his powers, personality traits, and physical features.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"S02M02 Danny and Vlad fusion.gif\" data-image-key=\"S02M02_Danny_and_Vlad_fusion.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Young Dark Danny (Danny Phantom) fusion with Vlad, gaining his powers, personality traits, and physical features.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAE